sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Tokenizer
    participant Model as LLM Model
    participant Sampler as Token Sampler
    participant Decoder as Detokenizer
    
    User->>API: Input prompt
    API->>Tokenizer: Encode text
    Tokenizer->>Tokenizer: Convert to token IDs
    Tokenizer-->>API: Token IDs [1, 234, 567, ...]
    
    API->>Model: Forward pass
    
    loop Token Generation
        Model->>Model: Self-attention
        Model->>Model: Feed-forward
        Model->>Model: Layer norm
        Model-->>Sampler: Logits (vocab size)
        
        Sampler->>Sampler: Apply temperature
        Sampler->>Sampler: Top-k filtering
        Sampler->>Sampler: Top-p (nucleus) sampling
        Sampler-->>Model: Next token ID
        
        alt Stop token generated
            Model->>Decoder: Complete sequence
        else Continue generation
            Model->>Model: Append token, continue
        end
    end
    
    Decoder->>Decoder: Convert IDs to text
    Decoder-->>API: Generated text
    API-->>User: Response
    
    Note over Model,Sampler: KV-Cache optimization:<br/>Reuse past key-values
    Note over Sampler: Sampling params:<br/>temp=0.7, top_k=50,<br/>top_p=0.9
